function showTab(name){activeTab=name;for(const id of ['dashboard','streams','cloud'])$(id).hidden=id!==name;for(const b of document.querySelectorAll('[data-tab]')){const selected=b.dataset.tab===name;b.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(selected));b.tabIndex=selected?0:-1;}}
function openPrivateResult(){const issue=pendingPrivate||privateResult;if(!issue)return;try{if(!current(issue.ctx)){clearPrivate();return;}}catch{clearPrivate();return;}if(!$('private-dialog').open)$('private-dialog').showModal();$('private-result').focus();}
